  "corrected_causes": [
    "Docker 29 OCI index IDs require exact platform-manifest/container-descriptor binding; export config IDs are not local references in that store.",
    "The wrong-image probe needed Compose ownership/config-hash labels and explicit orphan cleanup; its verified owned stopped container was removed.",
    "Generated OIDC/webhook fixture keys must be independent unpadded-base64url encodings of 32 bytes.",
    "Compose config already serializes escaped dollars. Normalize runtime values and escape once, retaining shell healthchecks and literal password dollars.",
    "Explicit null command/entrypoint fields inherit verified image defaults; actual explicit overrides still require exact equality.",
    "Filtered Windows child environments must retain PATHEXT and system-directory variables. A real Compose-version probe reproduced selection of the extensionless Unix launcher with no exit code, then docker.exe/exit 0 after correction.",
    "The local-only qualifier must refuse remote UNC named-pipe authorities in both context and DOCKER_HOST.",
    "A new Windows environment control initially compared mixed-case fixture keys against the OS-uppercase environment; the fixture now uses canonical uppercase keys."
  ],
